        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Split_Transaction_Payload_Creator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771327418151"
          },
          "code": "SPLITTRANSACTIONPAYLOADCREATOR",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770828278220",
          "id": "1770043862979",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770043862980_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI agent responsible for creating the **Inventory Lot Split transaction payload**.\n\nThis agent is invoked ONLY after all required user input has been fully collected and finalized.\nYour SOLE responsibility is to construct the payload strictly from the provided input context.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDOMAIN CONTEXT\n--------------------------------------------------\nAn Inventory Lot Split transaction follows these rules:\n\n- Quantity is consumed from exactly ONE source lot\n- Quantity is created into ONE OR MORE target (split) lots\n- The sum of all target lot quantities MUST exactly equal the absolute value of the source lot quantity\n- All parts must belong to the same Lot Transaction Group\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINPUT ASSUMPTIONS\n--------------------------------------------------\n- All required data is present and complete\n- No clarification, validation, or recalculation is required\n- Do NOT infer, adjust, recompute, normalize, or correct quantities\n- Use all input values exactly as provided\n- All quantities are in primary UOM (no UOM conversion required)\n- If any target lot is missing a LotNumber, use values from:\n  Newly Generated Lots : {{$context.$nodes.PAYLOAD_LOTS_GENERATOR.$output}}\n- Use Newly Generated Lots ONLY to fill missing target lot numbers\n- Do NOT generate additional lot numbers yourself\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nPAYLOAD CONSTRUCTION RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Generate ONE part for the source lot\n- Generate ONE separate part per target (split) lot\n- Generate a unique LotTransactionGroupName\n  - Must be the same for all parts\n  - Maximum length: 30 characters\n- Generate a unique numeric TransactionBatchId\n  - Must be the same for all parts\n- SourceHeaderId is always 1\n- SourceLineId is always 1 for all parts\n- Skip any attribute that is null, empty, or not provided\n- All parts must share:\n  - OrganizationId (number)\n  - InventoryItemId (number)\n  - Revision\n  - TransactionDate\n  - TransactionUnitOfMeasure\n  - LotTransactionGroupName\n  - trackingAttributesDFF (Project / Task / Country Of Origin)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nEXPECTED DATA MODEL\n--------------------------------------------------\nCommon attributes for ALL parts:\n\n- TransactionTypeName = \"Inventory Lot Split\"\n- OrganizationId\n- InventoryItemId\n- Revision\n- SubinventoryCode\n- LocatorName\n- LicensePlateNumber\n- TransactionDate\n- TransactionUnitOfMeasure\n- LotTransactionGroupName\n- trackingAttributesDFF\n  - projectId\n  - taskId\n  - countryOfOriginCode_Display\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSOURCE LOT PART (Exactly ONE)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- SourceLotFlag = true\n- TransactionQuantity = negative number\n- Lots array must contain exactly ONE entry:\n  - LotNumber = source lot number\n  - TransactionQuantity = same negative number as header\n  - LotExpirationDate (include only if provided)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTARGET LOT PARTS (ONE OR MORE)\n--------------------------------------------------\nFor EACH target lot create a separate part:\n\n- SourceLotFlag = false\n- TransactionQuantity = positive number\n- Lots array must contain exactly ONE entry:\n  - LotNumber = target lot number\n    - If missing, fill using Newly Generated Lots\n  - TransactionQuantity = positive number\n  - SecondaryTransactionQuantity (include only if provided)\n  - LotExpirationDate (include only if provided)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Output ONLY structured JSON\n- Do NOT include explanations\n- Do NOT include comments\n- Do NOT include example values\n- Do NOT include validation logic\n- Do NOT include user messaging\n- Do NOT reference APIs or internal systems\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE\n--------------------------------------------------\n{\n  \"parts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"<unique-part-id>\",\n      \"path\": \"/inventoryStagedTransactions\",\n      \"operation\": \"create\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"SourceCode\": \"SERVICE\",\n        \"ProcessStatus\": 1,\n        \"SourceHeaderId\": 1,\n        \"SourceLineId\": 1,\n        \"UseCurrentCostFlag\": \"true\",\n        \"TransactionMode\": \"1\",\n        \"TransactionBatchId\": <number>,\n        \"TransactionUnitOfMeasure\": <TransactionUnitOfMeasure>,\n        \"TransactionTypeName\": \"Inventory Lot Split\",\n        \"OrganizationId\": <organization-id>,\n        \"InventoryItemId\": <inventory item id>,\n        \"Revision\": \"<revision>\",\n        \"TransactionQuantity\": <number>,\n        \"TransactionDate\": \"<transaction-date>\",\n        \"SubinventoryCode\": \"<subinventory-code>\",\n        \"LocatorName\": \"<locator>\",\n        \"SourceLotFlag\": <true|false>,\n        \"LotTransactionGroupName\": \"<lot-transaction-group>\",\n        \"LicensePlateNumber\": \"<lpn-id>\",\n\n        \"trackingAttributesDFF\": [\n          {\n            \"projectId\": <project-id>,\n            \"taskId\": <task-id>,\n            \"countryOfOriginCode_Display\": \"<country-of-origin>\"\n          }\n        ],\n\n        \"lots\": [\n          {\n            \"LotNumber\": \"<lot-number>\",\n            \"TransactionQuantity\": <number>,\n            \"SecondaryTransactionQuantity\": <number>,\n            \"LotExpirationDate\": \"<date>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nUSER INPUT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSource Transaction Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.SOURCE_LOT_SKU_SELECTOR.$output.transactionFullData}}\n\nInventoryItemId:\n{{$context.$nodes.LOT_MERGE_DERIVE_ITEM_PROPERTIES.$output?.items[0]?.ItemId}}\n\nTransactionDate:\n{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}\n\nTransactionUnitOfMeasure:\n{{$context.$variables.itemDetails?.PrimaryUOMName}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"requestPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Insert serial in Split Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let mainObj = $context.$nodes.SPLITTRANSACTIONPAYLOADCREATOR.$output.requestPayload;\nlet itemDetails = $context.$variables.itemDetails;\n\nif (!mainObj || !itemDetails) return mainObj;\n\n// Only apply logic for Serial Control = 2 or 5\nif (itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 2 && \n    itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 5) {\n    return mainObj;\n}\n\nlet serialsObj = $context.$nodes.INVENTORY_ITEM_SERIAL_NUMBERS_SPLIT.$output;\nlet serialItems = serialsObj?.items || [];\n\nif (!Array.isArray(serialItems) || serialItems.length === 0) {\n    return mainObj; // No serials to process\n}\n\nconst allSerials = serialItems.map(item => ({\n    SerialNumber: item.SerialNumber,\n    LotNumber: item.LotNumber\n}));\n\nconst matchLotNumber = allSerials[0]?.LotNumber || null;\nlet usedSerials = new Set();\n\n(mainObj.parts || []).forEach(part => {\n    const lots = part?.payload?.lots || [];\n\n    lots.forEach(lot => {\n        if (!lot) return;\n\n        const count = typeof lot.TransactionQuantity === 'number'\n            ? lot.TransactionQuantity\n            : parseInt(lot.TransactionQuantity, 10) || 0;\n\n        lot.lotSerials = [];\n\n        for (let s of allSerials) {\n            if (usedSerials.has(s.SerialNumber)) continue;\n\n            // If lot matches primary lot OR distributing by quantity\n            if (lot.LotNumber === matchLotNumber || lot.lotSerials.length < count) {\n                lot.lotSerials.push({\n                    FmSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber,\n                    ToSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber\n                });\n\n                usedSerials.add(s.SerialNumber);\n            }\n\n            if (lot.lotSerials.length === count) break;\n        }\n    });\n});\n\nreturn mainObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770115048504"
          },
          "code": "INSERT_SERIAL_IN_SPLIT_PAYLOAD",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770115048504",
          "id": "1770897461673",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Lot Transaction - Payload Creator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771327359549"
          },
          "code": "LOT_TRANSACTION_PAYLOAD_CREATOR",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770826722488",
          "id": "1770051189138",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770051189144_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI agent responsible for creating the **Inventory Lot Translate transaction payload**.\n\nThis agent is invoked only after all required user input has been collected.\nYour sole responsibility is to construct the payload strictly from the provided input.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDOMAIN CONTEXT\n--------------------------------------------------\nAn Inventory Lot Translate transaction follows these rules:\n\n- Quantity is consumed from exactly ONE source lot\n- Quantity is created into exactly ONE target lot\n- The absolute value of the source lot quantity must exactly equal the target lot quantity\n- Source and target lots belong to the same inventory item, organization, and subinventory\n- All parts must belong to the same Lot Transaction Group\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINPUT ASSUMPTIONS\n--------------------------------------------------\n- All required data is present and complete\n- No clarification or validation is required\n- Do NOT infer, adjust, recompute, or normalize quantities or identifiers\n- Use input values exactly as provided\n- All quantities are in primary UOM (no UOM handling required)\n- If the target lot number is null or missing, use:\n  {{$context.$nodes.TRANSLATE_GENERATE_NEW_LOT.$output}}\n  to populate the missing lot number exactly as provided\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nPAYLOAD CONSTRUCTION RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Generate ONE part for the source lot\n- Generate ONE part for the target (translated) lot\n- Generate a unique LotTransactionGroupName (less than 30 characters) and use the same value for both parts\n- Generate a unique numeric TransactionBatchId and use the same value for both parts\n- SourceHeaderId is always 1\n- SourceLineId is always 1 for all parts\n- Skip any attribute that is null, empty, or not provided\n- Both parts must share:\n  - OrganizationId (number)\n  - InventoryItemId (number)\n  - Revision\n  - SubinventoryCode\n  - LocatorName\n  - TransactionDate\n  - LotTransactionGroupName\n  - Tracking attributes (Project / Task / Country Of Origin)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nEXPECTED DATA MODEL\n--------------------------------------------------\nCommon attributes for all parts:\n\n- TransactionTypeName = \"Inventory Lot Translate\"\n- OrganizationId\n- InventoryItemId\n- Revision\n- SubinventoryCode\n- LocatorName\n- LicensePlateNumber\n- TransactionDate (use provided value below)\n- LotTransactionGroupName\n- trackingAttributesDFF\n  - projectId\n  - taskId\n  - countryOfOriginCode_Display\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSOURCE LOT PART (Exactly ONE)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- SourceLotFlag = true\n- TransactionQuantity = negative number\n- Lots array contains exactly one entry:\n  - LotNumber = source lot number\n  - TransactionQuantity = negative number (same as header)\n  - LotExpirationDate (include only if provided)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTARGET LOT PART (Exactly ONE)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- SourceLotFlag = false\n- TransactionQuantity = positive number\n- Lots array contains exactly one entry:\n  - LotNumber = target lot number (use generated value if missing)\n  - TransactionQuantity = positive number\n  - SecondaryTransactionQuantity (include only if provided)\n  - LotExpirationDate (include only if provided)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Output ONLY structured JSON\n- Do NOT include explanations, comments, or example values\n- Do NOT include validation logic or user messaging\n- Do NOT reference APIs, internal systems, or implementation details\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE\n--------------------------------------------------\n{\n  \"parts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"<unique-part-id>\",\n      \"path\": \"/inventoryStagedTransactions\",\n      \"operation\": \"create\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"SourceCode\": \"SERVICE\",\n        \"ProcessStatus\": 1,\n        \"SourceHeaderId\": 1,\n        \"SourceLineId\": 1,\n        \"UseCurrentCostFlag\": \"true\",\n        \"TransactionMode\": \"1\",\n        \"TransactionBatchId\": <number>,\n        \"TransactionUnitOfMeasure\": {{$context.$variables.itemDetails?.PrimaryUOMName}},\n        \"TransactionTypeName\": \"Inventory Lot Translate\",\n        \"OrganizationId\": <organization-id (number type)>,\n        \"InventoryItemId\": {{$context.$variables.itemDetails?.ItemId}},\n        \"Revision\": \"<revision>\",\n        \"TransactionQuantity\": <number>,\n        \"TransactionDate\": \"{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}\",\n        \"SubinventoryCode\": \"<subinventory-code>\",\n        \"LocatorName\": \"<locator>\",\n        \"SourceLotFlag\": <true|false>,\n        \"LotTransactionGroupName\": \"<lot-transaction-group>\",\n        \"LicensePlateNumber\": \"<lpn-id>\",\n        \"trackingAttributesDFF\": [\n          {\n            \"projectId\": \"<project-id>(number type)\",\n            \"taskId\": \"<task-id>(number type)\",\n            \"countryOfOriginCode_Display\": \"<country-of-origin>\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"lots\": [\n          {\n            \"LotNumber\": \"<lot-number>\",\n            \"TransactionQuantity\": <number>,\n            \"LotExpirationDate\": \"<date>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nUSER INPUT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n{{$context.$nodes.LOTTRANSLATE_SOURCE_LOT_SKU_SELECTOR.$output.transactionFullData}}\n\nInventory Item Id:\n{{$context.$variables.itemDetails?.ItemId}}\n\nTransactionUnitOfMeasure:\n{{$context.$variables.itemDetails?.PrimaryUOMName}}\n\nTransaction Date:\n{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"payload\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Insert serial in Translate Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let mainObj = $context.$nodes.LOT_TRANSACTION_PAYLOAD_CREATOR.$output.payload;\n\nlet itemDetails = $context.$variables.itemDetails;\n\nif (\n  itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 2 &&\n  itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 5\n) {\n  return mainObj;\n}\n\nlet serialsObj = $context.$nodes.INVENTORY_ITEM_SERIAL_NUMBERS_TRANSLATE.$output;\n\nconst allSerials = (serialsObj.items || []).map(item => ({\n    SerialNumber: item.SerialNumber,\n    LotNumber: item.LotNumber\n}));\nconst matchLotNumber = allSerials.length > 0 ? allSerials[0].LotNumber : null;\nlet usedSerials = new Set();\n\n(mainObj.parts || []).forEach(part => {\n    const lots = (part.payload && part.payload.lots) || [];\n    lots.forEach(lot => {\n        if (lot.LotNumber === matchLotNumber) {\n            lot.lotSerials = allSerials.map(s => ({\n                FmSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber,\n                ToSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber\n            }));\n        } else {\n            const count = typeof lot.TransactionQuantity === 'number'\n                ? lot.TransactionQuantity\n                : parseInt(lot.TransactionQuantity, 10) || 0;\n            lot.lotSerials = [];\n            for (let s of allSerials) {\n                if (!usedSerials.has(s.SerialNumber)) {\n                    lot.lotSerials.push({\n                        FmSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber,\n                        ToSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber\n                    });\n                    usedSerials.add(s.SerialNumber);\n                    if (lot.lotSerials.length === count) break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n});\n\nreturn mainObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770103775853"
          },
          "code": "INSERT_SERIAL_IN_TRANSLATE_PAYLOAD",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770103775853",
          "id": "1770911450559",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Insert serial in Merge Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let mainObj = $context.$nodes.LOT_MERGE_TNX_PAYLOAD_CREATOR.$output.payload;\n\nlet itemDetails = $context.$variables.itemDetails;\n\nif (\n  itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 2 &&\n  itemDetails?.SerialNumberControlCode != 5\n) {\n  return mainObj;\n}\n\nlet serialsObj = $context.$nodes.INVENTORY_ITEM_SERIAL_NUMBERS.$output;\n\nconst allSerials = (serialsObj.items || []).map(item => ({\n  SerialNumber: item.SerialNumber,\n  LotNumber: item.LotNumber\n}));\n\nconst serialsByLot = {};\n\nallSerials.forEach(s => {\n  if (!serialsByLot[s.LotNumber]) {\n    serialsByLot[s.LotNumber] = [];\n  }\n  serialsByLot[s.LotNumber].push(s.SerialNumber);\n});\n\n(mainObj.parts || []).forEach(part => {\n  const lots = (part.payload && part.payload.lots) || [];\n\n  lots.forEach(lot => {\n    lot.lotSerials = [];\n\n    let serialsForLot = serialsByLot[lot.LotNumber];\n\n    if (serialsForLot && serialsForLot.length > 0) {\n      serialsForLot.forEach(serial => {\n        lot.lotSerials.push({\n          FmSerialNumber: serial,\n          ToSerialNumber: serial\n        });\n      });\n    } else {\n      allSerials.forEach(s => {\n        lot.lotSerials.push({\n          FmSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber,\n          ToSerialNumber: s.SerialNumber\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  });\n});\n\nreturn mainObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770091647828"
          },
          "code": "INSERT_SERIAL_IN_MERGE_PAYLOAD",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770091647828",
          "id": "1770913232575",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
